{"availability":"available","full":"mohitagw15856/notugly","name":"notugly","description":"Designs that are provably not ugly. Generate a whole design system from a seed — every text pairing clears WCAG AA before you see it. Plus a GitHub Action that fails a PR on a contrast regression.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-16T18:25:18Z","updated":"2026-08-25T18:33:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mohitagw15856.github.io/notugly","topics":["accessibility","avatars","color-palette","contrast-checker","design-system","design-tokens","generator","github-action","oklch","svg","tailwindcss","ui","wcag","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://mohitagw15856.github.io/notugly","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:06.637Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:06.637Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:06.637Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:06.637Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108473161478246700","postId":"2108473161478246700","postedAt":"2026-10-09T08:22:29.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:04:06.637Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your design is ugly. Here, have this one instead.","You need colours. You pick a blue. You pick a grey that goes with the blue. Twenty minutes later you have eleven greys, none of them go together, and the button text is unreadable but you've stopped being able to tell.","This does that bit for you, and it can't produce an unreadable pairing — not because it checks afterwards and apologises, but because the text colour is worked out from the background. There's no code path that produces bad contrast."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mohitagw15856/notugly/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c49da29e5fea8b3669f42467817e53a2381f9ae279e2d182a7dea766dfee02a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:08.421Z"},"ove